# Sales, Inventory, Purchases & Finance Dashboard (Power BI)

An interactive multi-page **Power BI** report covering sales performance, warehouse transfers, inventory health, purchasing, cash/bank accounts, expenses, and account balances, supported by dynamic slicers (`month_name`, store/warehouse, bank account) and side navigation.

